  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.10.0 - Kuwantima: DatePicker and TimePicker, controls 17 and 18. Kuwantima.DataGrid: no changes (lockstep bump).\n\nTwo new core controls. Classes=\"Kuwantima\" on Avalonia's DatePicker or TimePicker now restyles the whole control - the field in your form and the looping-column flyout that opens under it (accent highlight band with the warm-orange edge, step arrows on the hovered column, accept/dismiss row). Hover, pressed, keyboard focus, placeholder, disabled and the native :error pseudo-class all follow the same recipes as ComboBox and TextBox, and the inline validation message still renders. CalendarDatePicker and Calendar are not part of this release.\n\nAdditive only: no selector, resource key or class was renamed or removed. Control count moves from 16 to 18.\n\nKuwantima.DataGrid ships again under the same number with identical content - both packages are versioned in lockstep; see CLAUDE.md's Version Management section for why.",
